  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293848</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_010_000&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あいつら……
どこ行ったんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Where did those two go?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293972</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_010_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……わからない……
ここ、どこなんだろう……
なんかイヤな感じがする……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I don't know...I don't recognize this
place, either... For some reason, I
have a really bad feeling about this...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294036</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_010_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>クルクルッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Kurukuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294120</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_010_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ダオス！
倒したはずなのに……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dhaos! I thought we defeated you...!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294332</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_010_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>今の私は
私であって、私でない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The man you are seeing is not really me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294332</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_010_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おまえたちが戦った
私もまた</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The same goes for the Dhaos you fought.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294416</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_010_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>…………？
どーゆーことだよっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...!? What the hell do you mean by that!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294496</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_010_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>残存思念、
それが今の私だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I am nothing more than
a lingering recollection.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294560</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_010_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>残存思念？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A lingering recollection?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294712</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_010_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>執着、遺恨、悔い</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Fixation, enmity, disdain...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294712</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_010_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ここはそうした思念が
本来の時空からはぐれ
集った暗黒時空なのだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This whole time-space continuum is such an existence.
A place materialized by feelings scattered through
time. This is the Darkened Time-Space.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294864</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_010_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あんたのこととか
ここがどことか
どーだっていい！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't understand the very first thing you
mean about this place or about you!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294864</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_010_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>仮面つけたヤツら、
見なかったか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Have you seen those masked screwballs?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295008</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_010_014&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……『&lt;Red&gt;焔王（ほむらおう）の楔&lt;White&gt;』
へ行った</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...They have braved into the
&lt;Red&gt;Linchpin of the Lord of Fire&lt;White&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295008</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_010_015&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>追うがいい！
貴様らの因縁を</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Chase them if you so desire. Alas,
you cannot escape your fate.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295104</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_010_016&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>消えた……
なんか親切すぎねーか？
あいつ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He's gone... Did he seem...nicer
than usual to you? That guy...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295180</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_010_017&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それに襲ってこなかったシ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Besides, he didn't try to attack us...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295296</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_010_018&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……今、見たの、
前会ったダオスとは
なんか違う雰囲気だったね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...This "Dhaos" we met had a
different air to him than the
one we've met before.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295492</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_010_020&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>とにかく、
『&lt;Red&gt;焔王の楔&lt;White&gt;』ってとこ
行ってみよーぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>At any rate, let's head to the
&lt;Red&gt;Linchpin of the Lord of Fire&lt;White&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
